Receives the debouncer instance.\nWhen provided, replaces the default cleanup (cancel + abort); use it to call flush(), cancel(), add logging, etc.\nWhen using onUnmount with flush, guard your callbacks since the component may already be destroyed."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"debouncer","children":[{"type":"text","value":"debouncer"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"AngularAsyncDebouncer.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AngularAsyncDebouncer"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFn"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSelected"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"extends","text":"Extends","level":2},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfn","text":"TFn","level":3},{"id":"tselected","text":"TSelected","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"onunmount","text":"onUnmount?","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"debouncer","text":"debouncer","level":5},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [async-debouncer/injectAsyncDebouncer.ts:15](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/async-debouncer/injectAsyncDebouncer.ts#L15)\n\n## Extends\n\n- `AsyncDebouncerOptions`\\<`TFn`\\>\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFn\n\n`TFn` *extends* `AnyAsyncFunction`\n\n### TSelected\n\n`TSelected` = \\{\n\\}\n\n## Properties\n\n### onUnmount?\n\n```ts\noptional onUnmount?: (debouncer) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [async-debouncer/injectAsyncDebouncer.ts:24](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/async-debouncer/injectAsyncDebouncer.ts#L24)\n\nOptional callback invoked when the component is destroyed. Receives the debouncer instance.\nWhen provided, replaces the default cleanup (cancel + abort); use it to call flush(), cancel(), add logging, etc.\nWhen using onUnmount with flush, guard your callbacks since the component may already be destroyed.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### debouncer\n\n[`AngularAsyncDebouncer`](AngularAsyncDebouncer.md)\\<`TFn`, `TSelected`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: AngularAsyncDebouncerOptions\ntitle: AngularAsyncDebouncerOptions\n---\n\nDefined in: [async-debouncer/injectAsyncDebouncer.ts:15](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/async-debouncer/injectAsyncDebouncer.ts#L15)\n\n## Extends\n\n- `AsyncDebouncerOptions`\\<`TFn`\\>\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFn\n\n`TFn` *extends* `AnyAsyncFunction`\n\n### TSelected\n\n`TSelected` = \\{\n\\}\n\n## Properties\n\n### onUnmount?\n\n```ts\noptional onUnmount?: (debouncer) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [async-debouncer/injectAsyncDebouncer.ts:24](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/async-debouncer/injectAsyncDebouncer.ts#L24)\n\nOptional callback invoked when the component is destroyed. Receives the debouncer instance.\nWhen provided, replaces the default cleanup (cancel + abort); use it to call flush(), cancel(), add logging, etc.\nWhen using onUnmount with flush, guard your callbacks since the component may already be destroyed.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### debouncer\n\n[`AngularAsyncDebouncer`](AngularAsyncDebouncer.md)\\<`TFn`, `TSelected`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n"}
